// Mutually dependent streams via previous value (section 3.2)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix I (KScript and KSWorld), section 3.2, lead-in 'one can define a pair of values that each follows the other:', PDF page 26 (printed page 25)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

a <- true fby when timer then b’
b <- false fby when timer then a’

